# Example training config for the DINOv3 deepfake classifier

Reference hyperparameters — see [src/training/train.py](../src/training/train.py)
for the authoritative CLI defaults.

```yaml
model:
  name: DINOv3 ViT-S/16
  weights: experiments/checkpoints/weights/model.safetensors
  img_size: 256
  patch_size: 16

task:
  num_classes: 2        # binary classification: real / fake

training:
  epochs: 5
  batch_size: 32
  lr_backbone: 1.0e-5
  lr_head: 1.0e-3
  weight_decay: 0.05
  scheduler: CosineAnnealingLR

data:
  img_size: 256
  mean: [0.485, 0.456, 0.406]
  std:  [0.229, 0.224, 0.225]
```
